    {
      "id": "p0189-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Mettaton forces the main character to participate in a television game show. In the English version of Underta/e, the game show begins with a flashing sign that says \"GAME SHOW''. Game shows are usually called \"quiz shows\" in Japan, though, so the sign was updated to say \"QUIZ SHOW\" in the Japanese release.",
        "raw": "Mettaton forces the main character to participate in a television game show. In\nthe English version of Underta/e, the game show begins with a flashing sign that\nsays \"GAME SHOW''. Game shows are usually called \"quiz shows\" in Japan,\nthough, so the sign was updated to say \"QUIZ SHOW\" in the Japanese release.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
